          <span class="brief__kind brief__kind--project">Edge AI &amp; CV</span>
          <span class="brief__status brief__status--active">ACTIVE MISSION</span>
          <span class="debrief-period">Oct 2026 – Present</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="debrief-title">AeroScan: Real-Time Military Aircraft Detection &amp; Tactical Edge AI</h3>
        <p class="debrief-role">Lead AI Systems &amp; Computer Vision Engineer</p>
      </header>

      <section class="debrief-sec">
        <h4 class="debrief-h4">// Objective &amp; Problem Statement</h4>
        <p class="debrief-p">
          Tactical airspace surveillance requires ultra-low latency target identification of advanced 5th-gen combat aircraft under variable weather conditions, severe camera vibrations, and hardware compute constraints. Standard detection models suffer from bounding-box drift during steep-angle bank turns.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="debrief-sec">
        <h4 class="debrief-h4">// System Architecture Pipeline</h4>
        <div class="pipeline">
          <div class="pipeline__node">
            <span class="pipeline__step">01</span>
            <strong>RTSP / Camera Stream</strong>
            <span class="pipeline__sub">High-FPS Video Ingestion</span>
          </div>
          <span class="pipeline__arrow">➔</span>
          <div class="pipeline__node">
            <span class="pipeline__step">02</span>
            <strong>YOLOv11-OBB</strong>
            <span class="pipeline__sub">Oriented Bounding Box</span>
          </div>
          <span class="pipeline__arrow">➔</span>
          <div class="pipeline__node pipeline__node--highlight">
            <span class="pipeline__step">03</span>
            <strong>TensorRT 10 Engine</strong>
            <span class="pipeline__sub">FP16 CUDA Execution</span>
          </div>
          <span class="pipeline__arrow">➔</span>
          <div class="pipeline__node">
            <span class="pipeline__step">04</span>
            <strong>ByteTrack Filter</strong>
            <span class="pipeline__sub">Trajectory Multi-Object Tracking</span>
          </div>
          <span class="pipeline__arrow">➔</span>
          <div class="pipeline__node">
            <span class="pipeline__step">05</span>
            <strong>Tactical HUD UI</strong>
            <span class="pipeline__sub">Telemetry &amp; Threat Alert</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="debrief-sec">
        <h4 class="debrief-h4">// Technical Benchmarks &amp; Key Metrics</h4>
        <div class="debrief-metrics">
          <div class="metric-card">
            <span class="metric-card__val">~1.8 ms</span>
            <span class="metric-card__label">Inference Latency</span>
            <span class="metric-card__sub">&gt;500 FPS throughput on TensorRT FP16</span>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-card">
            <span class="metric-card__val">15 Classes</span>
            <span class="metric-card__label">Combat Aircraft</span>
            <span class="metric-card__sub">F-22, Su-57, B-2 Spirit, J-20, etc.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-card">
            <span class="metric-card__val">94.2%</span>
            <span class="metric-card__label">mAP@50 Precision</span>
            <span class="metric-card__sub">Robust under cloud &amp; speed occlusions</span>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-card">
            <span class="metric-card__val">-58%</span>
            <span class="metric-card__label">VRAM Footprint</span>
            <span class="metric-card__sub">Quantized for tactical field edge devices</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="debrief-sec">
        <h4 class="debrief-h4">// Engineering Highlights</h4>
        <ul class="debrief-list">
          <li><strong>Oriented Bounding Boxes (OBB):</strong> Captures exact aircraft roll angles and heading vectors without background noise inclusion.</li>
          <li><strong>ByteTrack Association:</strong> Eliminates ID switching during high-speed crossing maneuvers and tight formation flight.</li>
          <li><strong>Docker Edge Packaging:</strong> Automated build scripts producing optimized container images for tactical edge field servers.</li>
        </ul>
