      <section class="debrief-sec">
        <h4 class="debrief-h4">// Objective &amp; Problem Statement</h4>
        <p class="debrief-p">
          Food rescue organizations face sudden high-volume donation spikes from supermarkets and hotels. Traditional synchronous backend architectures stall under burst loads, causing perishable food batches to expire before matching with nearby humanitarian shelters.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="debrief-sec">
        <h4 class="debrief-h4">// System Architecture Pipeline</h4>
        <div class="pipeline">
          <div class="pipeline__node">
            <span class="pipeline__step">01</span>
            <strong>Mobile / Web Client</strong>
            <span class="pipeline__sub">Burst Donation Events</span>
          </div>
          <span class="pipeline__arrow">➔</span>
          <div class="pipeline__node">
            <span class="pipeline__step">02</span>
            <strong>Laravel 12 API Gateway</strong>
            <span class="pipeline__sub">Stateless Auth &amp; Validation</span>
          </div>
          <span class="pipeline__arrow">➔</span>
          <div class="pipeline__node pipeline__node--highlight">
            <span class="pipeline__step">03</span>
            <strong>Redis Queue / Pub-Sub</strong>
            <span class="pipeline__sub">Asynchronous Job Dispatch</span>
          </div>
          <span class="pipeline__arrow">➔</span>
          <div class="pipeline__node">
            <span class="pipeline__step">04</span>
            <strong>PostGIS Engine</strong>
            <span class="pipeline__sub">Spatial Distance Matrix</span>
          </div>
          <span class="pipeline__arrow">➔</span>
          <div class="pipeline__node">
            <span class="pipeline__step">05</span>
            <strong>Volunteer Dispatch</strong>
            <span class="pipeline__sub">Real-Time Push Alerts</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

